@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Danh sach -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Chi tiet bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 + ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Nop hop le -> 201 + Location; gui truoc request 5
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "DTC245200851", "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200851/PTUDPT_HaiAnh" }

### 5. Doc lai luot nop vua tao -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Du lieu rong -> 400 + INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "", "repositoryUrl": "" }

### 7. Luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 + SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Bo sung: nop vao bai khong ton tai -> 404
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/repo" }

### Bai da dong -> 400 + ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/repo" }

### Thieu repositoryUrl -> 400 + INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001" }

### Sai Content-Type -> 415
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/repo" }

### JSON hong -> 400 do framework
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001",

### Sai phuong thuc -> 405, Allow: GET
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### Sai kieu route -> 404 rong
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/abc
